+    # a whole-request threshold on prompt tokens and its own per-token rates.
+    # Missing override fields fall back to the base rate for that component; a
+    # tier whose threshold is absent/non-positive or that carries no rate at all
+    # is malformed and ignored. The entry stores the LOWEST valid threshold so
+    # per-request selection (estimate_usage_cost) can walk every tier.
